00:10:45.006 --> 00:10:53.081
THIS GUY -- IT WON'T END WELL

00:10:48.676 --> 00:10:53.982
FOR US AND IT MAY STILL NOT END

00:10:53.214 --> 00:10:57.485
WELL FOR KIM.

00:10:54.115 --> 00:10:58.019
I AM WORRIED ABOUT THE PEOPLE IN

00:10:57.618 --> 00:10:59.721
NORTH KOREA.

00:10:58.152 --> 00:11:02.290
WE STILL HAVE TO ADDRESS THAT.

00:10:59.854 --> 00:11:04.625
IF THEY ARE STILL STARVING.

